  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Master&apos;s Degree Program in Digital Innovation(2023)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this master;s degree program in the field of digital innovation is to contribute to the economic and social development of developing countries by nurturing key talents who can make a significant impact. Through strengthening competencies in the digital innovation  field, the program aims to expand the international influence of south korea&#xb514;&#xc9c0;&#xd138; &#xb274;&#xb51c; &#xc815;&#xcc45; &#xb0b4;&#xc6a9;&#xc744; &#xbc18;&#xc601;&#xd55c; &#xcee4;&#xb9ac;&#xd058;&#xb7fc; &#xad6c;&#xc131;&#xc744; &#xd1b5;&#xd574; &#xb514;&#xc9c0;&#xd138; &#xc774;&#xb178;&#xbca0;&#xc774;&#xc158; &#xbd84;&#xc57c; &#xc5ed;&#xb7c9;&#xc744; &#xac15;&#xd654;&#xd55c; &#xacf5;&#xacf5;&#xc815;&#xcc45; &#xd575;&#xc2ec; &#xc9c0;&#xb3c4;&#xc790;&#xb97c; &#xc591;&#xc131;&#xd558;&#xc5ec; &#xd604;&#xc5c5;&#xc801;&#xc6a9;&#xc744; &#xd1b5;&#xd55c; &#xac1c;&#xb3c4;&#xad6d;&#xc758; &#xc0ac;&#xd68c; &#xacbd;&#xc81c; &#xd658;&#xacbd;&#xc801; &#xb3c4;&#xc2dc; &#xbb38;&#xc81c;&#xb97c; &#xd574;&#xacb0;&#xd568;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This program seeks to train core leaders in public policy with enhanced capabilities in the field of digital innovation, who can contribute to addressing societal, economic, and environmental issues in developing countries through practical applications. It also aims to provide education that can effectively address poverty issues and promote economic self-reliance in partner nations through the practical application of digital innovation technology</narrative>
  </description>
